WHAT YOU MAY DO WITHOUT ASKING
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Read, view and study the source code, story, artwork and documentation.
2. Clone the repository and run it locally, unmodified, for private evaluation
   and learning.
3. Quote short excerpts (a few lines of code, or a brief passage of text) in
   reviews, articles, teaching material or technical discussion, with clear
   attribution and a link back to this repository.
4. Link to this repository or to the author's published episodes.

